# Everything `flow:install-dev-cli` writes. In a real project these are committed
# tooling, like mvnw - the whole point is that every developer and agent on the
# repository gets the same instructions. Here they are regenerated with
# overwrite=true on every build, which is how the ITs come to drive the CLI the
# goal actually installs, so committing them too would only mean a dirty working
# tree after every edit to the shipped resources.
/.vaadin/
/.agents/
/.claude/
